5. The most important observation
                Tell the interviewer:
                
                                “The dominant workload is video delivery rather than video metadata access. 
                                        Therefore, I don't want application servers or databases serving the actual video bytes. 
                                        I'll separate the control plane from the data plane.”
                
                This is a very important L5-level insight.
                
                Control plane
                
                Handles:                
                                authentication
                                metadata
                                search
                                permissions
                                video processing orchestration   

                Data plane
                
                Handles:                        
                        actual video bytes
                        thumbnails
                        streaming
                
                That leads us to:

