                                  API Gateway / Services
                                           │
                                Metadata / Search / Auth
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                      Databases
                        
                        
                                      DATA PLANE
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                          CDN
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                     Object Storage
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                     Video Segments



