7. Playback Flow

                This is probably the most important sequence to explain.
                
                User clicks:                
                        youtube.com/watch?v=ABC

                Step 1                
                        Request goes through:

                                DNS
                                 ↓
                                CDN / Edge
                                 ↓
                                API Gateway

                Step 2                
                        Video Service retrieves metadata:
                                Video ID
                                Title
                                Description
                                Thumbnail
                                Manifest URL

                Step 3                
                        Client requests the video manifest.
                
                Step 4                
                        CDN serves the manifest.
                
                Step 5                
                        Client requests video segments.

                                Client
                                  ↓
                                CDN
                                  ↓
                                segment001
                                segment002
                                segment003
                                ...

                If the CDN has the segment:                
                        CACHE HIT                
                                No request to origin.

                If not:
                
                        CACHE MISS
                              ↓
                        Object Storage
                              ↓
                             CDN
                              ↓
                            Client
================================================================================================================================================================
8. Why CDN caching works extremely well
                Imagine a viral video:                
                        10 million users
                
                They may request the same segments.                
                        The first request:
                
                        User
                         ↓
                        CDN
                         ↓
                        Object Storage

        Then:
        
                CDN Cache
                
                        segment1
                        segment2
                        segment3
                
                The next millions of users get the content from the CDN.                
                This dramatically reduces origin bandwidth.
