24. Likes and Views
                Suppose a popular video receives:
                        1 million views/minute
                
                Updating a database row synchronously:
                
                        UPDATE videos
                        SET views = views + 1
                
                can become a hot row.

                Instead:
                
                        Playback Event
                              │
                              ▼
                        Message Queue
                              │
                              ▼
                        Aggregation
                              │
                              ▼
                        Persistent Store
                
                Aggregate counts asynchronously.
                
                This introduces eventual consistency, which is usually acceptable for view counts.

================================================================================================================================================================
25. Why asynchronous view counting?

                        Because:
                        
                        User watching video
                        
                        should not depend on:
                        
                        Database successfully incremented view count
                        
                        Playback should succeed even if analytics infrastructure is temporarily degraded.
                        
                        This is an important separation of concerns.
