35. Important Trade-offs

        This is the part I want you to practice saying naturally.

| Decision             | Why                                    | Trade-off                                |
| -------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| CDN                  | Reduce latency & origin bandwidth      | Cache invalidation/cost                  |
| Object storage       | Durable massive storage                | Higher access latency than local storage |
| Direct upload        | Avoid application bandwidth bottleneck | More complicated client flow             |
| Async transcoding    | Scalable processing                    | Video isn't immediately available        |
| Message queue        | Decoupling & resilience                | Eventual consistency                     |
| NoSQL/distributed DB | Horizontal scale                       | Query/transaction limitations            |
| Redis                | Very low latency                       | Memory cost / ephemeral nature           |
| Adaptive streaming   | Handles variable networks              | Multiple copies increase storage         |
| Async analytics      | Doesn't affect playback                | Counts may be delayed                    |


